title: AWS Application Load Balancer
agents: aws
catalog: cloud/aws
license: WTFPL
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors AWS Application Load Balancer (ALB) metrics via CloudWatch.
 It provides visibility into load balancer performance and health.

 Monitored metrics:

 - Request Count: Total number of requests processed

 - Target Response Time: Average response time in milliseconds

 - Healthy/Unhealthy Target Count: Number of healthy and unhealthy targets

 - HTTP Error Codes: ALB 4XX/5XX and Target 4XX/5XX counts

 - Active Connection Count: Current active connections

 Thresholds can be configured for response time, unhealthy targets, and
 active connections.

discovery:
 One service is created for each Application Load Balancer discovered.
